WEBVTT

00:07.320 --> 00:09.230
Just like the other cases.

00:09.230 --> 00:10.690
Poochi, what about the other girl?

00:10.990 --> 00:12.700
"The other girl"?

00:12.700 --> 00:16.700
Oh, you mean the magical girl that went streaking down the road?

00:16.700 --> 00:18.910
Apparently a bunch of people chased after her, but...

00:18.910 --> 00:20.120
I see.

00:21.540 --> 00:23.120
I'm sick of this!

00:23.120 --> 00:27.420
Why do my clothes disappear when the transformation wears off!?

00:30.170 --> 00:32.800
I don't know if that thing's a god or what,

00:32.800 --> 00:35.430
but it always disappears right when I need it!

00:36.260 --> 00:37.970
How am I supposed to make it home?

00:37.970 --> 00:38.720
Toi-san.

00:39.180 --> 00:40.350
Yuma-chan!

00:40.810 --> 00:43.850
Thank goodness. I finally found you.

00:43.850 --> 00:45.690
You're a traitor, Yuma-chan.

00:45.690 --> 00:47.940
I can't believe you ran off without me.

00:47.940 --> 00:53.400
I ran off to buy you clothes in case this happened again, but now you're calling me a traitor?

00:53.400 --> 00:56.490
You've shattered my delicate heart.

00:57.070 --> 01:00.580
Yuma-chan, I always believed in you!

01:00.580 --> 01:04.710
A complete one-eighty, huh?
I don't dislike that.

01:05.540 --> 01:06.830
Is this her?

01:07.210 --> 01:09.880
Yes. I witnessed her ability to achieve Divine Union.

01:10.760 --> 01:12.710
Her appearance is a bit
different from the photo.

01:13.920 --> 01:17.720
Is she manipulating time to age herself?

01:18.010 --> 01:19.680
Why would she do that?

01:19.930 --> 01:21.220
I don't know.

01:21.220 --> 01:23.270
But I can say one thing for certain:

01:26.730 --> 01:28.270
that girl

01:28.270 --> 01:31.020
harbors a Regalia inside of her.

03:03.950 --> 03:06.960
[Descent from Heaven<b>] </b>Could it be the real thing!? A magical girl appears! The sequel!

03:03.950 --> 03:06.960
[Descent from Heaven] Could it be the real thing!? A magical girl appears! The sequel!

03:04.330 --> 03:06.950
<i>No! No, no, no!</i>

03:06.950 --> 03:11.000
That's crazy, Toi-san!
It's gotten over 50 million views!

03:11.000 --> 03:15.040
That's gotta be, like,
half of Japan or something!

03:15.040 --> 03:17.760
Oh, God, why!?

03:17.760 --> 03:21.430
And check out the news headlines! They're all like, "Half-Naked Girl Captures Wanted Criminal"!

03:21.430 --> 03:25.310
