Archive

03:21.430 --> 03:25.310
    Rumors are spreading in Kamaya City about a magical girl that
was responsible for the recent capture of a bank robber who had
barricaded himself in the bank.
I was one of many in the crowd that day. I was walking through
the city when I encountered a boisterous crowd along one of the
major streets. Naturally my interest was piqued.
I pushed through the crowd heading towards the source of the
commotion when the crowd suddenly split down the middle.
And then, to my surprise, a half-naked girl with a bright red face
came rushing through!

03:21.840 --> 03:25.300
Here's one talking about how\
a magical girl solved a police case.

03:25.760 --> 03:28.430
You're the woman of the hour, Toi-san!

03:28.430 --> 03:30.060
If anyone finds out about me, it's all over.

03:30.060 --> 03:32.190
My life will be over.

03:32.190 --> 03:34.060
And all of this...

03:34.060 --> 03:36.020
is <i>your</i> fault!

03:36.020 --> 03:38.940
Toi-san, that's sacrilege!
You're talking to a god!

03:38.940 --> 03:41.950
It's the god of plague, if anything!

03:43.070 --> 03:44.910
God's Playing Dumb!

03:46.950 --> 03:49.460
Bank

03:53.330 --> 03:55.790
As I thought, the Night was here.

03:55.790 --> 03:57.750
Roy was on his way, but where is he?

03:59.510 --> 04:00.630
It's me.

04:00.880 --> 04:06.550
It would seem a flight attendant was found weak and unconscious on the flight Roy came in on.

04:07.850 --> 04:08.930
It can't be!

04:09.430 --> 04:11.770
So Roy was already...

04:12.100 --> 04:13.100
Yeah.

04:13.100 --> 04:14.730
We should proceed on the assumption

04:15.020 --> 04:17.860
that all the intel we've gathered has been compromised.

04:20.990 --> 04:24.490
Seems like they've finally caught on.

04:26.620 --> 04:29.080
Don't look so grim.

04:32.080 --> 04:34.120
I heard from Set.

04:34.120 --> 04:37.340
About your failure in the UK.

04:39.550 --> 04:41.510
Wicked tattoo you've got there.

04:41.510 --> 04:43.700
A present from the Anti-Creed?

04:44.260 --> 04:47.550
If it were me, I'd be so happy I'd kill myself.

04:47.550 --> 04:49.100
Ow, ow, ow!

04:49.100 --> 04:51.310
Don't be so angry.

04:51.600 --> 04:55.140
I'll introduce you to a better vessel.

04:57.980 --> 05:00.730
Entertainment

04:57.980 --> 05:00.730
Popular Medium

04:57.980 --> 05:00.730
Dosan Odagiri

04:58.310 --> 05:00.730
I sense the spirits of your
ancestors right behind you.

05:00.730 --> 05:03.280
Huh? For real?

05:03.280 --> 05:04.860
Reality TV, what a sham.

05:04.860 --> 05:08.660
Sh-Shingo-san, shouldn't you be at work?

05:08.660 --> 05:09.990
I'm off today.

05:09.990 --> 05:12.620
Besides, after yesterday's standoff...

05:12.620 --> 05:16.750
Well, we can't interrogate an injured man,
so there's nothing for me to do.

05:17.170 --> 05:19.380
The criminal got hurt?

05:19.710 --> 05:23.840
Yeah. He was drained of all his energy and has a case of amnesia.

05:24.260 --> 05:26.760
That painter Shimizu who attacked the shrine two days ago

05:26.760 --> 05:28.720
is in the hospital with the same symptoms.

05:30.970 --> 05:34.350
So, today I'm going to sleep.
Sleep the whole damn day!

05:34.350 --> 05:38.400
You know, I wonder if those two cases are connected somehow.

05:38.690 --> 05:40.270
They probably are.

05:40.270 --> 05:41.770
Like how?

05:41.770 --> 05:43.230
You seem awfully interested in this.

05:43.990 --> 05:48.070
Usually you don't want to hear about my work because of how violent it is.

05:48.070 --> 05:51.450
Th-They both happened close to me, so I'm curious.

05:51.450 --> 05:53.160
You're hiding something, aren't you?

05:53.160 --> 05:54.600
L-Like what!?

05:54.600 --> 05:56.290
Don't underestimate a cop's eyes.

05:57.790 --> 05:59.790
Shingo-san, um...

05:59.790 --> 06:03.630
Matoi, you went to the crime scene to gawk yesterday, didn't you?

06:03.630 --> 06:06.920
It was close to your school and
the incident at the shrine was recent, too.

06:06.920 --> 06:09.010
I understand why you're so curious,

06:09.340 --> 06:11.600
but don't go to dangerous places.

06:11.600 --> 06:13.930
But you were putting yourself in danger, too, Shingo-san!

06:13.930 --> 06:15.640
I knew you were watching.

06:15.980 --> 06:18.390
Th-That was...

06:18.390 --> 06:19.520
You're not being fair!

06:19.520 --> 06:20.480
Matoi!

06:25.740 --> 06:27.280
Just kidding!

06:27.950 --> 06:29.110
Sorry 'bout that.

06:29.490 --> 06:31.200
Just a cop's bad habits.

06:31.200 --> 06:32.280
Shingo-san...

06:32.280 --> 06:35.750
Anyway, come straight home after school. No detours!

06:37.250 --> 06:38.200
Okay.

06:40.080 --> 06:42.590
Well, it's a good thing you
weren't really scolded, right?

06:42.920 --> 06:45.300
But I feel like he's holding back.

06:45.300 --> 06:48.840
You can't expect him to confide in a child.

06:48.840 --> 06:51.680
But I'm in my second year of middle school already!

06:51.680 --> 06:53.800
But that's not the point.

06:54.180 --> 06:56.430
You've lived apart for over 10 years.

06:56.430 --> 06:59.480
He doesn't know how to relate to you.

06:59.480 --> 07:01.020
And the same goes for you.

07:01.020 --> 07:04.270
You still call him "Shingo" instead of Dad, right?

07:04.270 --> 07:08.610
It's not as easy as you think to start calling him "Dad" all of a sudden.

07:08.610 --> 07:09.780
Yuma!

07:09.780 --> 07:11.990
You too, Matoi. You two can head home for the day.

07:11.990 --> 07:15.790
You've got a test coming up. Go to your room and <i>study</i>!

07:15.790 --> 07:16.740
<i>Study</i>?

07:16.740 --> 07:17.790
Why the English?

07:18.040 --> 07:22.750
Since English is your weakest subject, Yuma,
I asked a private tutor to come help you.

07:23.040 --> 07:25.670
A private tutor?

07:24.920 --> 07:30.130
Delusion

07:26.630 --> 07:28.760
What are you having trouble with?

07:28.760 --> 07:30.050
It's a woman.

07:31.090 --> 07:34.600
Oh, you're the woman from before!

07:34.600 --> 07:36.140
Haruka Luciela.

07:36.140 --> 07:36.850
Bonjour.

07:37.100 --> 07:39.060
Oh, she's so fluent!

07:39.060 --> 07:40.430
Uh, but that's French.

07:40.730 --> 07:42.270
No problem!

07:42.270 --> 07:45.310
Luciela-san knows her English, too!

07:45.310 --> 07:47.780
Take care of Yuma, please.

07:47.780 --> 07:48.650
Of course.

07:52.780 --> 07:56.490
Why don't you join us?

07:56.490 --> 07:58.870
Me?

07:58.870 --> 08:02.250
I can teach other subjects besides English.

08:03.040 --> 08:06.130
Yuma, I want you to translate what I'm about to say back to Japanese.

08:06.130 --> 08:08.750
Okay, Luciela-sensei!

08:08.750 --> 08:11.550
"Tom's older sister has a dog."

08:11.880 --> 08:14.970
Sure! Tom is his older sister's dog!

08:15.720 --> 08:19.100
The correct answer is,
"Tom's older sister has a dog."

08:19.100 --> 08:20.890
What kind of family is that!?

08:20.890 --> 08:23.000
I don't know, maybe they're kinky.

08:23.600 --> 08:25.520
Your turn, Matoi.

08:26.480 --> 08:29.780
"I am interested in the apotropaic girl."

08:30.610 --> 08:36.120
Um, "I am interested in the... girl."

08:36.120 --> 08:39.030
I'm sorry, I don't know that word in the middle.

08:39.370 --> 08:42.960
"Apotropaic girl" roughly
translates to "exorcist girl."

08:42.960 --> 08:45.040
Oh, really?

08:45.040 --> 08:46.830
An exorcist girl...

08:47.080 --> 08:48.460
Wait, what?

08:48.460 --> 08:52.000
Luciela-sensei, you're interested in the Exorcist Girl?

08:52.000 --> 08:53.760
Yes. Very.

08:53.760 --> 08:56.890
Um, why have you been looking at me this whole time?

08:57.510 --> 08:59.220
Because you look like her.

08:59.220 --> 09:01.850
The girl who's popular on the internet.

09:01.100 --> 09:01.140
[Descent from Heaven] Could it be the real thing!? A magical girl appears!

09:01.850 --> 09:05.980
Y-You really think so? I don't see it at all!

09:05.980 --> 09:09.200
I'm curious as to why she appeared so suddenly,

09:09.200 --> 09:12.610
and what her intentions are.

09:13.570 --> 09:16.910
Again, why are you looking at me?

09:16.910 --> 09:21.370
I'll tell you an extra-special secret, Luciela-sensei.

09:21.370 --> 09:24.870
The Exorcist Girl's true identity is...

09:26.960 --> 09:29.420
Luciela-sensei, let's get back to our lesson.

09:29.420 --> 09:33.840
Yuma-chan's father will get mad if we start slacking.

09:33.840 --> 09:36.050
You're right. I apologize.

09:36.050 --> 09:40.220
In that case, let's move on to a lesson about our world and its dimensions.

09:42.180 --> 09:43.220
Huh?

09:48.230 --> 09:50.860
IATO is in contact.

09:51.690 --> 09:53.320
Leave them be.

09:53.320 --> 09:56.820
They can't do anything without a Regalia.

09:58.320 --> 10:00.660
The world we live in consists of three dimensions.

10:00.660 --> 10:02.950
three dimensions

10:00.990 --> 10:07.330
However, some of today's physicists
theorize that up to 24 dimensions exist.

10:03.370 --> 10:03.410
24 dimensions

10:07.330 --> 10:09.580
Um, Luciela-sensei?

10:09.580 --> 10:11.170
So here's the question:

10:11.170 --> 10:15.840
if we were to hypothesize that intelligent life exists in these other dimensions,

10:15.840 --> 10:17.630
do you believe that we,
beings of the third dimension,

10:17.630 --> 10:20.390
could see anything in
the fourth dimension or higher?

10:20.390 --> 10:21.390
Um...

10:21.390 --> 10:22.970
Could we see anything?

10:24.390 --> 10:27.690
I... I don't think we could.

10:27.690 --> 10:28.850
Correct.

10:28.850 --> 10:30.940
But you're also half wrong.

10:30.940 --> 10:35.440
If beings from a higher dimension were to enter ours, we should then be able to see them

10:35.730 --> 10:38.650
as if they were gods entering our earthly realm.

10:39.530 --> 10:44.580
Currently, there's a theory that all supernatural phenomena we cannot logically explain

10:44.580 --> 10:50.000
are the result of a being from a higher dimension influencing our world.

10:50.790 --> 10:52.930
Question, Luciela-sensei!

10:52.930 --> 10:56.130
Does that include demons?

10:56.130 --> 10:58.720
We cannot discount the possibility.

10:58.720 --> 11:01.140
But there's a more important question as well:

11:01.840 --> 11:05.600
why would beings from higher
dimensions come to our world?

11:05.600 --> 11:07.600
What are they after?

11:08.020 --> 11:11.600
Why are you still staring at me through all these questions?

11:11.600 --> 11:12.860
You don't know?

11:12.860 --> 11:14.400
O-Of course not.

11:15.110 --> 11:16.230
Are you sure?

11:16.230 --> 11:19.070
Why are you being so insistent?

11:21.830 --> 11:24.330
Dosan Odagiri

11:21.830 --> 11:24.330
Dressing Room 1

11:22.200 --> 11:24.330
Man, this world's just messed up.

11:24.580 --> 11:28.290
Most of its residents can't even see us,

11:28.290 --> 11:31.960
but some claim to have "spiritual sight"
and are obviously connected to our realm.

11:32.500 --> 11:35.210
What a useless talent.

11:35.590 --> 11:39.840
Still, their existence is quite convenient for us.

11:46.930 --> 11:49.140
Well? How's the new vessel?

11:50.640 --> 11:52.730
Not bad, eh?

12:09.700 --> 12:11.630
Night already?

12:12.550 --> 12:15.590
Something smells great.

12:15.590 --> 12:17.680
Matoi, what's for dinner?

12:17.680 --> 12:19.250
Beef stew.

12:19.250 --> 12:21.250
What are <i>you</i> doing here?

12:21.670 --> 12:25.090
Shingo-san, you know Luciela-sensei?

12:25.090 --> 12:27.470
Huh? Uh, kind of...

12:27.470 --> 12:29.510
Wait, why are you being so formal with her?

12:29.930 --> 12:34.480
The head priest at the shrine asked me to tutor the girls.

12:34.970 --> 12:39.730
When I heard Matoi was cooking dinner by herself, I offered to help.

12:39.730 --> 12:42.110
Luciela-sensei insisted on it.

12:42.400 --> 12:45.070
It's not like I'm angry.

12:45.070 --> 12:46.110
Hey, come here.

12:46.490 --> 12:48.650
Matoi, keep an eye on the stove.

12:48.650 --> 12:50.200
Y-Yes.

12:52.530 --> 12:53.950
What are you up to?

12:53.950 --> 12:56.090
Just as I said, I'm helping with dinner.

12:56.500 --> 12:59.580
Yeah, but you're the kind of woman who only acts out of self-interest.

12:59.580 --> 13:00.960
What's your game?

13:00.960 --> 13:03.290
Expecting something to happen at the shrine again?

13:03.840 --> 13:05.590
That's...

13:05.590 --> 13:07.170
Luciela-sensei!

13:07.550 --> 13:09.470
Yes, coming!

13:11.550 --> 13:14.720
Jeez, why!?

13:14.720 --> 13:17.680
I'm doing the Rite of Divine Possession,

13:17.680 --> 13:21.440
so where's the god that's going to come down to <i>me</i>?

13:21.440 --> 13:23.520
Yuma-chan! Dinner!

13:23.520 --> 13:24.940
We're having Salisbury steak.

13:25.570 --> 13:28.570
Heck ya! Tomorrow's gonna be a home run!

13:28.570 --> 13:31.280
Popular Medium
Dosan Odagiri

13:29.030 --> 13:31.280
I can see it. It's coming into focus.

13:31.610 --> 13:35.120
This guy again? He's everywhere.

13:35.120 --> 13:38.620
You put Matoi to bed this early?

13:38.620 --> 13:40.080
Well, yeah, since she's still just a child.

13:40.750 --> 13:43.500
Children grow up faster
than their parents think.

13:45.670 --> 13:49.680
Matoi calls you by your first name,
Sergeant Sumeragi?

13:50.050 --> 13:52.390
Don't meddle in my private life.

13:52.390 --> 13:55.100
Your conversations feel rather stiff for a father and daughter.

13:55.100 --> 13:59.770
By the looks of it, you two only recently started living together after being apart for a long time.

14:01.310 --> 14:03.520
You think you're some hotshot profiler now?

14:03.520 --> 14:04.940
What happened?

14:06.520 --> 14:10.070
A criminal investigator like me working in the city couldn't even raise a kid properly,

14:10.070 --> 14:13.660
so my mother and father got angry and took Matoi to my hometown.

14:14.240 --> 14:15.530
What about your wife?

14:17.490 --> 14:20.330
I'm sorry. That was too personal.

14:21.080 --> 14:22.620
Drink with me.

14:23.620 --> 14:24.960
You can drink, right?

14:27.920 --> 14:29.770
She disappeared?

14:29.770 --> 14:32.130
That's what the paperwork says.

14:32.130 --> 14:33.380
Did she give a reason?

14:35.390 --> 14:39.930
<i>Look after Matoi for me until I get back.</i>

14:41.890 --> 14:47.300
Shiori might not have told me
everything, but she never once lied!

14:47.570 --> 14:50.070
So I'll trust her. I'll wait.

14:50.070 --> 14:51.990
Matoi and I will wait together.

14:53.860 --> 14:55.450
She heard you.

14:55.450 --> 14:57.370
I let her hear me.

14:57.370 --> 14:59.000
You should talk to her about it.

15:00.370 --> 15:03.290
Is the woman in this picture your wife?

15:03.290 --> 15:07.590
She looks like that "Exorcist Girl" who's all over the Internet.

15:11.550 --> 15:13.170
What a tactless man.

15:15.510 --> 15:20.010
Shingo-san... thinks about mom, too.

15:29.530 --> 15:32.540
I see. So that's the god who lavished you in power.

15:33.320 --> 15:36.160
If you really are a god,

15:36.160 --> 15:38.820
if you really have mysterious powers,

15:38.820 --> 15:41.800
then please make my dad's wish come true.

15:42.370 --> 15:43.290
Because...

15:44.040 --> 15:46.250
it's my wish, too.

15:48.330 --> 15:50.750
What's with that attitude!?

15:55.300 --> 15:57.050
The Gate of Caelum opened.

16:00.100 --> 16:01.310
I'll handle it.

16:10.360 --> 16:12.070
It marched right in,

16:14.030 --> 16:15.800
so I have no reason to...

16:16.200 --> 16:17.240
hold back!

16:24.370 --> 16:25.370
Divine Union!

16:37.970 --> 16:39.090
What?

16:39.090 --> 16:40.900
Toi-san!

16:43.900 --> 16:45.420
Yuma-chan!

16:45.420 --> 16:46.450
Did you see that?

16:46.450 --> 16:48.060
You saw it too?

16:48.060 --> 16:49.730
It's over there!

16:49.730 --> 16:51.230
Wait up, Yuma-chan!

16:53.820 --> 16:55.000
A DR reading?

16:55.820 --> 16:57.110
And so close.

16:58.740 --> 17:00.000
Matoi-san?

17:05.380 --> 17:06.670
That's...

17:06.670 --> 17:08.050
Why?

17:16.710 --> 17:19.000
It's stronger than before.

17:19.300 --> 17:21.550
Could it be the latent abilities of the human it's possessing?

17:21.550 --> 17:23.640
Toi-san, it's a demon!

17:23.640 --> 17:25.500
This is a job for the Exorcist Girl!

17:25.930 --> 17:26.600
Huh?

17:26.600 --> 17:28.140
Hurry up and transform!

17:28.140 --> 17:30.390
B-But it's not that simple!

17:31.900 --> 17:33.810
What? No excuses!

17:33.810 --> 17:35.820
If you don't do it now, then when will you!?

17:35.820 --> 17:39.250
But I don't even know how to!

17:41.030 --> 17:43.320
It's coming this way!

18:14.980 --> 18:16.120
Stop!

18:20.410 --> 18:21.710
Sure enough, it's a Night.

18:21.710 --> 18:23.250
Run for it, you two.

18:24.710 --> 18:25.870
Hurry up!

18:33.420 --> 18:34.210
Fatima?

18:34.580 --> 18:36.140
I'll leave the other girl to you.

18:37.140 --> 18:38.100
Hurry.

18:38.100 --> 18:40.140
The barrier won't hold for long.

18:58.030 --> 18:59.000
What?

19:02.450 --> 19:04.410
That girl is Anti-Creed?

19:05.240 --> 19:06.120
This way.

19:06.120 --> 19:08.000
That child?

19:08.240 --> 19:11.600
She got hurt trying to protect us.

19:25.550 --> 19:27.140
No! Run away!

19:27.140 --> 19:28.500
She can't.

19:29.100 --> 19:30.100
Why!?

19:30.100 --> 19:31.600
She has orders.

19:32.070 --> 19:35.310
There is a task she must complete, even if it costs her her life.

19:39.400 --> 19:41.230
Her life? No!

19:46.820 --> 19:47.740
We must hurry.

19:49.490 --> 19:50.370
Wait!

19:50.370 --> 19:51.580
Matoi!

19:57.580 --> 19:58.900
Stop...

20:02.550 --> 20:05.010
Stop it!

20:31.780 --> 20:33.240
Toi-san!

20:33.950 --> 20:35.500
She achieved...

20:35.500 --> 20:36.910
...Divine Union.

20:40.170 --> 20:41.170
You...

20:42.170 --> 20:45.260
Um, I don't know what kind of demon you are,

20:45.260 --> 20:48.220
but you're going to leave that body right now!

20:59.480 --> 21:01.150
Please wait.

21:01.150 --> 21:04.730
I think we can talk this out or something.

21:08.320 --> 21:09.910
You'll never understand.

21:12.530 --> 21:14.200
These creatures are humanity's...

21:14.740 --> 21:15.540
No,

21:16.120 --> 21:17.580
they're my enemy.

21:22.380 --> 21:23.250
Clarus.

21:24.750 --> 21:26.600
Quaedum Fulmen!

21:34.000 --> 21:39.280
Mine own foe without love,
without mercy, and without pity.

21:46.740 --> 21:47.530
Such leads...

21:51.050 --> 21:54.040
down the path to destruction.

21:54.710 --> 21:56.870
Feeling your heart

21:56.870 --> 22:05.630
hito wa umarenagara hikari to kage wo

21:56.870 --> 22:05.630
It's natural for us all to be followed

22:05.630 --> 22:11.640
matoi tsuzukeru

22:05.630 --> 22:11.640
by light and shadow

22:11.640 --> 22:15.140
The lonely one

22:17.310 --> 22:19.350
Feeling your heart

22:19.350 --> 22:28.070
You can obtain all you've ever wanted

22:19.400 --> 22:28.110
hoshii mono subete te ni ireru koto

22:28.070 --> 22:34.330
sore ga shiawase nano

22:28.070 --> 22:34.330
But is that truly happiness?

22:34.330 --> 22:39.290
darekaga egao nara

22:34.330 --> 22:39.290
If someone is smiling,

22:39.290 --> 22:45.800
dokokade kitto naiteru hito ga ite

22:39.290 --> 22:45.800
somewhere, someone else is probably crying

22:45.800 --> 22:52.010
surechigau hodo itooshiku omou

22:45.800 --> 22:52.010
As our paths continue to cross,

22:52.010 --> 22:56.810
kimochi ga aru

22:52.010 --> 22:56.810
our love grows stronger

22:56.810 --> 23:01.810
hitotoki no aida ni

22:56.810 --> 23:01.810
In that short span of time

23:01.810 --> 23:08.320
bokura wa minna mujun wo dakishimete

23:01.810 --> 23:08.320
we embrace all contradictions

23:08.320 --> 23:16.450
as we watch the lights that lead us to tomorrow

23:08.360 --> 23:16.500
ashita e no hikari wo mitsume nagara

23:16.450 --> 23:21.630
aruiteku no kana

23:16.450 --> 23:21.630
I wonder if we'll keep walking this path

23:37.260 --> 23:40.020
Wow. So flashy.

23:41.850 --> 23:43.770
Wh-Who are you?

23:44.730 --> 23:48.000
You've been a nuisance, Lady Anti-Creed.

23:49.610 --> 23:51.070
I've found you!

23:51.730 --> 23:53.360
Creed Killer!

23:57.040 --> 24:00.730
That girl is prepared to fight the demons,

24:00.730 --> 24:03.830
but I have no reason to fight.

24:04.290 --> 24:11.050
Episode 4

24:04.290 --> 24:11.050
Her Resolution and My Reason

24:04.300 --> 24:07.130
Next time: "Her Resolution and My Reason."

24:07.840 --> 24:11.100
Even so, if you wish to protect someone...
